# Retroverse Agent Memory Checkpoint (Pilot)

For Retroverse assignments, consult `docs/agents/AGENT_MEMORY_PROTOCOL.md` and `docs/agents/checkpoints/retroverse.json` before rediscovering project status. Treat the checkpoint as a **handoff**, not as authority over current user instructions, runtime evidence, Studio's approved phase, or canonical data.

Report verified completed work, blockers, and one next action. Do not claim `handoffTest.status = PASS` without an independent resume test. Do not update the checkpoint unless the task permits edits, and never auto-approve a new Studio milestone or deploy because a checkpoint says to.

Preserve `.cursor/rules/retroverse-workflow.mdc` execution states and phase gates. This rule does not modify product behavior.
